      <section class="how-section" id="how-it-works"><div class="how-intro"><div class="section-kicker">FROM IDEA TO PAPER ART</div><h2>How the AI papercraft<br />generator works</h2><p>No fancy tools or design skills needed to get started. Just bring an idea — the three steps below take less than a minute.</p><a class="text-button" href="#generator">Give it a try <span>→</span></a></div><div class="steps"><article class="step"><span class="step-number">01</span><div class="step-icon">💭</div><h3>Imagine it</h3><p>Describe the creature, object, or scene you want to bring to life. A few specific words — colors, mood, setting — help the AI nail your vision.</p></article><article class="step"><span class="step-number">02</span><div class="step-icon">🎨</div><h3>Pick your style</h3><p>Explore playful looks, from low-poly shapes to blocky voxel builds. The same idea feels completely different in each style, so experiment freely.</p></article><article class="step"><span class="step-number">03</span><div class="step-icon">✂️</div><h3>Make it yours</h3><p>Use your design as inspiration for your next paper craft project — print it, share it, or tweak the prompt and generate a fresh variation.</p></article></div></section>

      <section class="ideas-section" id="ideas">
        <div class="section-kicker">NEED INSPIRATION?</div>
        <div class="section-heading"><h2>Papercraft ideas to try first</h2><p>Stuck on what to generate? These crowd-pleasers are a great starting point — type one in, tweak it, and make it yours.</p></div>
        <p class="ideas-text">Animals are the classic choice: a <b>cute panda munching bamboo</b>, a <b>low poly fox</b>, or a tiny hedgehog curled up for a nap. Builders love paper <b>castles</b>, <b>lighthouses</b> and cozy cottages, while fantasy fans can summon a <b>dragon guarding its treasure</b>. Seasonal picks work year-round too — a pixel-art heart for Valentine's Day, a smiling pumpkin for Halloween, or a blocky snowman for winter. Every subject works in every style, so the combinations are nearly endless: a pixel-art whale, a kawaii rocket, a voxel dinosaur. Start with one of these, then follow the <a href="/papercraft-ideas/">papercraft ideas hub</a> for many more, or browse the <a href="/gallery/">gallery</a> to see what other creators have generated. When a look makes you smile, save it — and check back often, because fresh designs land in the gallery every day.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="create-learn" id="tutorials">
        <div class="section-top"><div><div class="section-kicker">HANDS-ON PAPER CRAFT</div><h2>Tutorials &amp; paper guides</h2><p>Step-by-step folding tutorials, plus the know-how that makes every project turn out better. Prefer to create with AI first and fold later? Do both — generate a design above, then learn the folding basics below.</p></div><a class="text-button desktop-only" href="/origami/">All tutorials <span>→</span></a></div>
